        {
          "text": " Ejo enkiyang'et o ina siankiki narikori. “Wou!” Nchoo ilo oning ejo, “Wou!” Nchoo ilo oata enkure, elotu, nchoo ilo oyieu eng'amu enkare e mpuaan metii enkinyiang'a.",
